  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDEA - Ukrainians Voting: Organizing Trustworthy Elections (U-VOTE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The U-VOTE (Ukrainians Voting: Organizing Trustworthy Elections) programme, implemented by International IDEA, supports Ukraine&#x2019;s preparation for credible, inclusive, and secure post-war elections. Working with the Central Election Commission, Verkhovna Rada, NACP, and civil society, the project strengthens electoral integrity, cybersecurity, transparency in political finance, and voter participation. It contributes to the governance, public sector capacity, and gender equality sectors. Gender and inclusion are mainstreamed, ensuring participation of women, youth, displaced persons, and veterans. U-VOTE enhances democratic resilience and supports Ukraine&#x2019;s path toward accountable, European-aligned governance.</narrative>
  </description>
